# Needs the dev test stock (TST) in a test save. The one list in Economy → Investments: over a
# stock's 30-day line the game's stock tooltip opens with its large chart; the line under the pointer is outlined and a
# click anywhere on it opens the game's dialog; a purchase gives its line the holding (shares, avg cost, gain) and
# Sell, and with Group on it moves into Your portfolio; in the dialog Buy | Sell switches sides in
# place. Selling the shares back in cleanup puts it back.
name investments list: hover chart, outline, click a line, a purchase, grouping and the Buy | Sell switch
monitor remember
monitor-sort Change
monitor-change percent
investments-sort sync off
investments-sort Change
close-economy
investments-list on
set-price TST 100
run-days 1
remember TST
show-economy
wait 1.5
# from the top, whatever an earlier visit left
investments-scroll -100000
expect-investments All TST
# a click on a pill flips every pill (and the Change sort) between % and ₡, as in the Monitor
investments-scroll-to TST
expect-text FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsRow-TSTChange %
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsRow-TSTChange
wait 0.5
expect-text FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsRow-TSTChange ₡
expect-text FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsSort Sort: Change ₡
expect-hidden BuySellInvestmentPanel
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsRow-TSTChange
wait 0.5
expect-text FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsRow-TSTChange %
investments-scroll-to TST
hover FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsRow-TSTSpark 0.5 0.5
wait 0.3
expect-visible InvestmentTooltip
capture investments-list-hover-chart
hover off
wait 0.3
expect-hidden InvestmentTooltip
# the stock under the pointer is outlined; a click anywhere on its line opens the dialog
hover FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsRow-TST 0.3 0.5
wait 0.3
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsRow-TSTOutline
hover off
wait 0.3
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsRow-TSTOutline
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsRow-TST
wait 1
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-SideBuy
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-Limit
close-dialog
wait 0.5
investments-scroll-to TST
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsRow-TST
wait 1
type FinanceOverhaulShareAmountField 4
click Button
wait 1.5
investments-scroll-to TST
expect-owned-delta TST 4
expect-investments All TST
expect-text FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsRow-TSTHolding 4 shares · avg ₡100
capture investments-list-tst-held
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsGroup
wait 0.5
investments-scroll -100000
expect-investments Portfolio TST
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsHeading-Portfolio
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsGroup
wait 0.5
# with the dialog open, the line behind it under the pointer is not outlined
investments-scroll-to TST
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsRow-TST
wait 1
hover FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsRow-TST 0.3 0.5
wait 0.3
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsRow-TSTOutline
hover off
close-dialog
wait 0.5
# the dialog turns from Buy to Sell and back without closing
investments-scroll-to TST
click FinanceOverhaulInvestmentsRow-TST
wait 1
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-SideSell
wait 0.5
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-StopLossSell
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-Limit
capture invest-dialog-sell-side
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-SideBuy
wait 0.5
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-Limit
close-dialog
cleanup:
monitor restore
sell-back TST 4
set-price TST 100
close-dialog
investments-list restore
close-economy
